Thanks to all those who responded to my plea for help. A summary of the 
responses follows:
i)   find the useful potions (confuse / paralyse / sickness / speed), then
     use these to help flatten the shopkeeper
ii)  wait for a dwarf or rock mole to make a new way out
iii) find a cursed "gain level" potion and use this to teleport out
iv)  read any spellbook - samurai's intelligence isn't too good, so this
     should give the "wrenching sensation" and teleport you out
v)   kick the door out from a spot adjacent to it, pay the shopkeeper for 
     the damage, and walk out.
I was amused to find that most of the responses suggested killing him - a
reflection on the kind of people who play hack, or just those who read this
notes group? ;-}
Since I try to avoid the "hack-and-slay" approach to Nethack (naturally
lawful I guess - and I WAS playing a samurai :-) ), I kicked the door in
and paid the 320 zorkmids. This got me out (only to be killed on the same
level by a ratwere, but that was my fault :-( ).

Thanks for all the suggestions,

DaveP


